<title>UK: WEW retail operations director resigns.</title>
<headline>WEW retail operations director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Discount department store operator WEW Group Plc said on Monday its retail operations director, Kevin Gunter, had resigned from the board effective August 31.</p>
<p>Gunter is leaving to head a newly-formed food retailing company, based in northern England, WEW said in a statement.</p>
<p>WEW said Stephen Sherman, currently assistant to the retail operations director, would take over Gunter's duties.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
